	)
	(text "Supercap hold-up (rework): U47 charges the cap to\n2.5 V at 100 mA, bypasses V_BUCK to +3V3 in normal\noperation, and boosts from the cap to a flat 3.3 V\nwhen V_BUCK collapses -- the rail no longer sags,\nand the 2.9 V cutoff chain is gone.  OSEL/VCHG/ICHG\nare 1% code resistors: 4.75k = 3.3 V out, 6.65k =\n2.5 V termination (bounded by VIN - 800 mV), 22.1k\n= 100 mA charge.\nHold: ~2.6-3.9 s @0.7 A (5 F, 2.5 -> 1.5-1.9 V\nfloor at that load, eta 0.9, flat 3.3 V out) --\nrides any firing event with margin.\nVBUCK_OK (100k/1M off V_BUCK) replaces CAP_ACTIVE,\nINVERTED: HIGH = buck present, LOW = riding the cap.\nEN/MODE to VIN = auto buck/boost.  Keep L7 and C141\ntight to U47 -- the SW node is hot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 298.45 53.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d78f2efc-97b2-4c80-8dd2-4f8c9252c4c0")
	)
